@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Reference solution. ewma_chart estimates the centre line and sigma from the baseline only, as imr_chart does, and judges every point against exact time-varying limits. With lambda 0.2 and L 3 the in-control average run length is about 500 points, so roughly one false alarm per 500 parts should be expected; tune L for the plant's tolerance. The chart says a shift happened, not why: the nozzle-wear cause has to be confirmed by a person.
